# module.prop keys this line overrides, applied by build.sh after module/ is
# staged. version / versionCode are not overridable — they stay defined once, in
# module/module.prop. The two lines update independently, hence the manifest.
name=AlwaysSleek [Inject]
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/marcmyworld/AlwaysSleek/main/update-inject.json
description=[Inject build] Strong Play Integrity in one sleek drop-in module. Hardware attestation + an auto-refreshed Pixel fingerprint. Tap Action.
